#: i18n/en.yaml:246
msgid "Training Resources"
msgstr "Trejnaj Rimedoj"

#. training-resources-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:248
msgid ""
"In addition to training and educational material found on the Internet, "
"Krita produces its own training material to help you learn all of the tools "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"Krom trejna kaj eduka materialo trovita en la Interreto, Krita produktas "
"sian propran trejnan materialon por helpi vin lerni ĉiujn ilojn rapide."

